#: ../../guide/storages.rst:3
msgid "FSM storages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/storages.rst:5
msgid "The FSM (see :doc:`fsm`) delegates persistence to a *storage*. aiorubi ships one for every common backend and a small interface for writing your own. All storages implement the same contract, so switching is a one-line change at the :class:`~aiorubi.dispatcher.dispatcher.Dispatcher`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/storages.rst:17
msgid "At shutdown the dispatcher closes the storage for you (``dispatcher.fsm.close`` is registered as a shutdown callback), so connections are released when ``await dp.stop_polling()`` / the polling loop ends."
msgstr ""

